## Request headers

| Name | Type | Description |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Authorization | string | ****** Required. Learn more about [authentication and authorization](/en-us/graph/auth/auth-concepts). |
| Content-Type | string | Nature of the data in the body of an entity. Required. |

## Request body

In the request body, supply a JSON representation of [attachment](resources/attachment) object.

## Response

If successful, this method returns `201 Created` response code and [attachment](resources/attachment) object in the response body.

## Examples

